# Normalise line endings.
#
# Windows checkouts use CRLF locally; the repository and the Linux build
# machine see LF. Without this, the first commit made on a different OS
# rewrites every line of every file and the diff becomes unreadable. This
# project has already hit CRLF-vs-LF trouble once in its source files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.glb  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
